#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3828 
msgid ""
"Specifies whether to send the results in the message body or as an "
"attachment."
msgstr "結果を本文に入れるか添付にするかの指定"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6351 
msgid "Specifies which metadata type is returned"
msgstr "返すメタデータのタイプを指定します"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2225 
msgid ""
"Specifies which type of bucket state. Defaults to \"all\".\\\n"
"\"good\" only returns good (non-corrupt) buckets.\\\n"
"\"corrupt\" only returns corrupted buckets that have a corruptReason.\\\n"
"\"all\" returns all buckets."
msgstr ""
"バケツの状態のタイプを指定します。デフォルトは「all」です。\\\n"
